    {
      "path": ".changeset/1793110373-actions.md",
      "summary": "Require fresh PR head checks after rebase or cherry-pick preparation before merging",
      "details": "Rebase and cherry-pick preparation now push the generated commit to the PR branch and return `result: updated` with `merged: false`. Wait for checks on the new `head-sha`, then run the action again to fast-forward that exact checked commit. A head already based on the base branch is fast-forwarded without replaying it again, including in cherry-pick mode.\n\nUpdate workflows that expected preparation and merging in one run to handle `updated` and trigger the later merge run. Use a token that starts PR checks when the head is pushed. Post-update scripts and workflows dispatched on the base branch do not authorize an immediate merge. Dry runs now leave both branches unchanged.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "id": "actions",
          "kind": "package",
          "bump": "major",
          "origin": "direct-change",
          "evidence_refs": [],
          "change_type": "major"
        }
